<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- HUNTER DOUGLAS H1 PROFIT UP 21 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE- HUNTER DOUGLAS H1 PROFIT UP 21 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)	     4.22  vs   3.50</p>
<p>    Net profit				76.3   vs  62.9</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		    1.28  vs   1.11</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     138.3   vs 124.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected window blinds maker Hunter</p>
<p>Douglas to report a first-half net profit of 74-77 mln guilders.</p>
<p>    Net interest charges		  22.6   vs  28.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 115.7   vs  95.2</p>
<p>    Tax					 38.9   vs  32.0</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
